# Slow: sprite sheet decode before any roll; Pair<Offset, Float> per die/frame in non-slot path.
# Why: cached imageResource runs before the early return; at() boxes its return values.
# Expected win: defer two sheets; remove two result pairs and boxed values per fallback frame.
# Risk: first throw still decodes synchronously; async prewarm remains an owner integration task.
# Animatable reads already occur in Canvas draw: no parent 60 Hz recomposition fix needed.
